            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1001-f2" n="46" xml:id="d1001-f2-content">
                <p>Fritz Mandl; see telegrams 1348, June 26, 1945 and 3115, December 13, 1945, from
                    Buenos Aires, <ref target="frus1945v09#pg_463"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1945, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ix</hi>, pp.
                        463</ref> and <ref target="frus1945v09#pg_493">493</ref>, respectively.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
